    {
      "$id": "87c9979d-5b09-46b9-9039-abe44c0596ff",
      "code": "//TEAM FRAY NOTE - place the below script at the point in your crouch where you'd like to allow tapping down during \"crouch_out\" to jump to \"crouch_in\". This functionality allows crouches in quick succession to feel snappy. \r\nCommon.allowJumpToCrouchIn();",
