      "code": "//plays heavy dust effect horizontally flipped (scaleX:-1)\r\nmatch.createVfx(new VfxStats({spriteContent: \"global::vfx.vfx\", animation: GlobalVfx.DUST_START_HEAVY, scaleX:-1}), self);",
