    {
      "$id": "b31c8a7a-70cd-4405-a024-99c985debfa8",
      "code": "//script which tells the character to launch the projectile. The projectile's x and y offset are configured in the character Script.hx, and the projectile's speed and other functionality can be configured in the projectile's Script.hx. \r\nfireNSpecialProjectile();\r\n//script which starts a cooldown timer before you can use the neutral special again. This can be configured in the character Script.hx.\r\nstartNeutralSpecialCooldown();\r\n//plays light dust effect\r\nmatch.createVfx(new VfxStats({spriteContent: \"global::vfx.vfx\", animation: GlobalVfx.DUST_START_LIGHT}), self);",
      "length": 1,
      "pluginMetadata": {
      },
      "type": "FRAME_SCRIPT"
