      "$id": "8bfd6137-3435-41e5-afe3-9ee99247fc20",
      "code": "//TEAM FRAY NOTE - This is an example attack that is currently not used. You can rename this animation and its HitboxStats if you'd like to replace an existing animation.\r\n\r\nCommon.setAutocancel(true);\r\nAudioClip.play(GlobalSfx.WHOOSH_2);\r\n",
