    {
      "$id": "fa396ea2-b558-4a59-a7ce-5070cb1858ff",
      "code": "//TEAM FRAY NOTE - plays when the bottom 2/3rds of your grounded character is hit, or when the middle 1/3rd of your aerial character is hit. The Collision Body Layer is present with grounded settings to prevent the character from snapping upward when landing in a hurt light state.",
