      "code": "//calls a light sparkle effect\r\nmatch.createVfx(new VfxStats({spriteContent: \"global::vfx.vfx\", animation: GlobalVfx.SPARKLE_LIGHT, x: 110, y: -30}), self);\r\n//calls generic whoosh sound\r\nAudioClip.play(GlobalSfx.WHOOSH_2);",
